This repository uses a split license layout.

The toolchain programs and repository-level build/test glue are licensed under
the GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version.
That applies to:

- archiver/
- assembler/
- compiler/
- driver/
- linker/
- simulator/ (except third-party code carrying its own notice)
- test/
- repository-root build and documentation files

The complete GPL-3.0 license text is in `COPYING`.

Everything under these cartridge-facing trees is covered under CC0-1.0:

- libraries/
- examples/

Their complete CC0-1.0 texts are in `libraries/LICENSE.txt` and
`examples/LICENSE.txt`. Each file in those trees also carries an explicit CC0
notice. Third-party code outside those trees retains its own license notice; for
example, `simulator/mos6502/LICENSE.txt` remains in force.
